flowchart TB
    C[Customer App<br/>Scan → Cart → Payment → Receipt]
    S[Staff Dashboard<br/>Operations Command Center]

    API[FastAPI Backend<br/>Modular REST API]
    DB[(PostgreSQL Database)]
    EVT[Event / Job Processing]

    DEM[Demand Forecasting]
    CON[Congestion Prediction]
    INV[Inventory Intelligence]

    DEC[Decision Engine<br/>What should the store do next?]
    AG[Operations Agent<br/>Advanced Layer]

    C --> API
    S --> API
    API --> DB
    API --> EVT
    EVT --> DEM
    EVT --> CON
    EVT --> INV
    DEM --> DEC
    CON --> DEC
    INV --> DEC
    DEC --> S
    DEC --> AG
    AG --> API
    AG --> S
